{
  "id": "respectful-disagreement",
  "title": "禮貌表達不同意見",
  "titleEn": "Disagreeing respectfully",
  "category": "校園與學習",
  "level": "中級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/respectful-disagreement.webp",
    "alt": "Maya 和 Ben 在學校桌邊討論換書活動的地點；Ben 指向窗外庭院，Maya 指著手機上的雨雲圖示，桌上放著書本和兩種場地的草圖。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Maya and Ben are choosing a "
        },
        {
          "text": "location",
          "wordIds": [
            "location"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for a Friday book swap with thirty students."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Maya 和 Ben 正在為三十位學生參加的週五換書活動挑選場地。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "ba43a0e41bdce9b2bc3ad97b67e77d32207948b42be88ae5dfe08dc601e712bf",
        "sha256": "c51ff86353bf0127b5e1d7e344f52fc9a889a5133dd04dd6058261cd06fe0199"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben points to the school "
        },
        {
          "text": "courtyard",
          "wordIds": [
            "courtyard"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "We could hold it here",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-could-hold-it-here"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because there's plenty of space.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 指著學校中庭說：「我們可以在這裡辦，因為空間很充足。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "0ebea6c3f5f93e07ed2b5df79285327dd386bd8c28e6d67ab95829cf12d1c8d0",
        "sha256": "a81580ad1ba51e432c9c1b7ff4776d5a0ea71c02ece83ba13f4e7f21ed78dd73"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "I see your point, but",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-see-your-point-but"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the "
        },
        {
          "text": "forecast",
          "wordIds": [
            "forecast"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " says it might rain,” Maya replies."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Maya 回答：「我懂你的想法，不過天氣預報說可能會下雨。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "6181069f06638dc97cd8728205364fa9c31125d9fb19c210ccc5fc44ad9a2ffb",
        "sha256": "eb82d6d5f48a85236b6db8e83a7577510f706ab93ae4355f48509f2828ed10f9"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "My main ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "my-main-concern-is"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "concern",
          "phraseIds": [
            "my-main-concern-is"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "concern"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is",
          "phraseIds": [
            "my-main-concern-is"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " keeping the books dry.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「我最在意的是讓書本保持乾燥。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "2db447e863086fdc89d4a158844375a3e243fd7c33f7029154aa631a3a28028b",
        "sha256": "b87e6312330d11c8d61f993a0aa60336fe307e7951342e9ab9840b5b495807e6"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben suggests the library instead, although he is not sure whether it is "
        },
        {
          "text": "available",
          "wordIds": [
            "available"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 改提議用圖書館，不過他不確定那裡能不能使用。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "69d08967090a76609f192d2168c5ed7f50394587011a584df9a3a2dea6fddf14",
        "sha256": "c1d14f1bf58cd956758a80d314f1df8b404c725d8bc16edbda5b3ae4fdd9f2e3"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's compare the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-compare-the-options"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "options",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-compare-the-options"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "options"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " before we decide,” Maya says."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Maya 說：「我們先比較各個選項，再做決定吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "86f25807952bc76d4f1f95abd7030248a96ef2164ddb2dc999bd6918947506e4",
        "sha256": "dd3c653c53cf3005224dba7d1615b45a1bbe305cc6e4e99dabddd21c681f4f9a"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben agrees: “"
        },
        {
          "text": "That sounds reasonable",
          "phraseIds": [
            "that-sounds-reasonable"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", as long as we check how much space we can use.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 表示同意：「聽起來很合理，只要我們確認一下有多少空間可以用就好。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d84bfd449bd03dcab46e2fadfc9a2142697a0bed5ed669317c2a889c294460c6",
        "sha256": "6e4897726a51160bf1a76aad99af7ecc94b90d775c3168469a56deb320709109"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They write down their shared goal: a place with enough room and "
        },
        {
          "text": "protection",
          "wordIds": [
            "protection"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " from the rain."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們寫下共同目標：找一個空間足夠、又能遮雨的地方。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/respectful-disagreement/8.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "69e0983b78036642b9efca1815e7c0277fb1edabe2becf961d63362914dd2ac3",
        "sha256": "d7c58fbc5de7aa6c9d6aae4d403f695076b5b55ff889a10e0a70c6b5f349ec02"
      }
    }
  ],
